{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CdtvC8DRziraPiMFUHfYv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Action Plan\n\n1. **Retry the health check** (1–2 times with brief backoff)\n   - Cold-start timeout is expected and transient on first invocation\n   - A second attempt should succeed once the serverless runtime is warm\n\n2. **If retry succeeds:** Record the service as **HEALTHY** (with a note that initial call timed out due to cold-start)\n\n3. **If retry fails again:** Record the service as **DEGRADED/UNAVAILABLE**\n   - Two consecutive timeouts suggest a real issue beyond cold-start\n   - Do not route work to it; escalate or use fallback routing\n\n4. **Log the cold-start event** for observability\n   - Timestamp, duration, retry outcome\n   - Helps distinguish cold-start from genuine failures\n\n5. **Route work only after confirming health** via successful retry\n\n---\n\n**Key principle:** A single timeout on first invocation of a cold-start service is *not* a capability failure—it's expected. A second timeout is."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":219,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":233,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}}
